      "content": "but that's just what people say to be nice. \"skills\" dont matter when you've lost your entire identity. everyone in my field is moving forward and i'm just... stuck in this wreckage. it's like i'm a ghost already. i look at my life and there's nothing but this massive mistake. part of me thinks it would be easier to just stop everything than to face the humiliation of living like this. it just feels like the most logical thing to do when everything is already broken.",
